{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12097","headline":"送傅管记赴蜀军 · 钱起","name":"送傅管记赴蜀军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"终童之死谁继出，燕颔儒生今俊逸。\n主将早知鹦鹉赋，飞书许载蛟龙笔。\n峨嵋玉垒指霞标，鸟没天低幕府遥。\n巴山雨色藏征斾，汉水猨声咽短箫。\n赐璧腰金应可料，才畧纵横年且妙。\n无人不重乐毅贤，何敌能当鲁连啸。\n日暮黄云千里昏，壮心轻别不销魂。\n勤君用却龙泉劒，莫负平生国士恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12097.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12097","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}